# E-06 (#313): this file used to ignore /specs/generated/ while 13 files were
# TRACKED inside it. Git ignores only UNTRACKED paths, so the rule was
# decorative -- and it made a regeneration that deleted eight tracked files
# invisible in `git status`, which showed deletions only. The corpus IS
# committed here, as it is in the other three examples, so the rule is gone
# rather than the files.
